    "detailed_description": "Enter the thrilling world of &quot;Bloody Downsizing,&quot; where financial analyst John Varga transforms into a lethal force to be reckoned with. In this heart-pounding rogue-lite arena shooter, John must rely on his wits and newfound combat skills to survive the most brutal downsizing his company has ever seen.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192990/extras/cccd8f9a203b47608ed8605c54a1896b.poster.avif?t=1740235457\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192990/extras/cccd8f9a203b47608ed8605c54a1896b.webm?t=1740235457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192990/extras/cccd8f9a203b47608ed8605c54a1896b.mp4?t=1740235457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Master the game's slow-motion feature to exploit your enemies' vulnerabilities and make each kill a breathtaking cinematic experience. Make every round unique as you choose your profile, enhance your character, and wield deadly weapons to obliterate waves of relentless foes. Will you rise as the last one standing or become another victim of the savage downsizing?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192990/extras/991e808c4a7c3bd0746d4ad7c3c7c215.poster.avif?t=1740235457\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192990/extras/991e808c4a7c3bd0746d4ad7c3c7c215.webm?t=1740235457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192990/extras/991e808c4a7c3bd0746d4ad7c3c7c215.mp4?t=1740235457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>High-octane, rogue-lite arena gameplay that puts you in the shoes of lone John Varga, showcasing visceral, bloody combat and strategic decision-making.<br></li><li>An array of unique profiles to choose from, each tailored to a different playstyle that brings its own strengths and weaknesses.<br></li><li>A dynamic upgrade system that enables players to enhance their character and obtain mighty weapons, making John Varga an unstoppable force.<br></li><li>Persistent blood effects add a layer of gritty realism and immersion, keeping you on the edge of your seat as you navigate the treacherous battleground of corporate downsizing.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Enter the thrilling world of &quot;Bloody Downsizing,&quot; where financial analyst John Varga transforms into a lethal force to be reckoned with. In this heart-pounding rogue-lite arena shooter, John must rely on his wits and newfound combat skills to survive the most brutal downsizing his company has ever seen.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192990/extras/cccd8f9a203b47608ed8605c54a1896b.poster.avif?t=1740235457\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192990/extras/cccd8f9a203b47608ed8605c54a1896b.webm?t=1740235457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192990/extras/cccd8f9a203b47608ed8605c54a1896b.mp4?t=1740235457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Master the game's slow-motion feature to exploit your enemies' vulnerabilities and make each kill a breathtaking cinematic experience. Make every round unique as you choose your profile, enhance your character, and wield deadly weapons to obliterate waves of relentless foes. Will you rise as the last one standing or become another victim of the savage downsizing?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192990/extras/991e808c4a7c3bd0746d4ad7c3c7c215.poster.avif?t=1740235457\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192990/extras/991e808c4a7c3bd0746d4ad7c3c7c215.webm?t=1740235457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192990/extras/991e808c4a7c3bd0746d4ad7c3c7c215.mp4?t=1740235457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>High-octane, rogue-lite arena gameplay that puts you in the shoes of lone John Varga, showcasing visceral, bloody combat and strategic decision-making.<br></li><li>An array of unique profiles to choose from, each tailored to a different playstyle that brings its own strengths and weaknesses.<br></li><li>A dynamic upgrade system that enables players to enhance their character and obtain mighty weapons, making John Varga an unstoppable force.<br></li><li>Persistent blood effects add a layer of gritty realism and immersion, keeping you on the edge of your seat as you navigate the treacherous battleground of corporate downsizing.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Survive the onslaught in &quot;Bloody Downsizing,&quot; a rogue-lite arena shooter set in a cutthroat corporate world. Play as John Varga, a financial analyst, thrust into a chaotic battle for survival. Customize your profile, power up, and harness the epic slow-motion feature to deliver jaw-dropping kills.",
